ede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record in Casey County runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 206% of normal and July to August at 56% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 55% of normal and June to July at 152% of normal on the middle. A preliminary estimate for grid 20581 puts August to September 2026 at 76.1.</p>"}
